WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:11.530
Dividing Driver!

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:13.320
Power launched!

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:19.990
Arresting Field, expanding!

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:23.960
Repression Field, expanding!

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:26.290
Proceeding to compress and shift the surrounding area!

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.460
Fitted onto GaoGaiGar's left arm is the...

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:34.630
...Dividing Driver, a high-tech tool that for a set time, compresses...

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:38.640
...and shifts a large area of land by warping dimensional space.

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:51.110
One Month Ago

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:50.020
GGG developed this...

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:52.940
...battlefield-generating device...

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:56.530
...in order to minimize collateral damage during battles.

00:00:57.240 --> 00:00:59.030
Dividing Driver...

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:00.950
This is the Key to Victory!

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:04.120
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:07.020
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:13.970
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:18.020
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:24.740
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:29.020
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:33.940
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:37.860
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:40.660
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:44.420
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:01:46.570 --> 00:01:49.420
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:52.590
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:52.590 --> 00:01:55.130
Final Fusion, approved!

00:01:55.330 --> 00:01:58.260
Now transform into a superhero!

00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:01.220
Warping dimensional space!

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:05.300
Dividing Driver!

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:12.940
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:18.820
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:21.770
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:21.770 --> 00:02:25.660
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:27.620
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:30.790
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:33.090
The Fugitive Zonder

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:35.760
<i>The Fugitive Zonder</i>

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:43.680
Revived by Mamoru's mysterious power, Gai launches a deadly battle...

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:46.930
...against the steam locomotive Zonder Robot.

00:02:50.230 --> 00:02:53.110
Creating a Battlefield with the Dividing Driver...

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:56.570
...GaoGaiGar smashes his enemy to pieces.

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:58.110
However...

00:02:58.440 --> 00:02:59.780
No, stop!

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:01.700
You can't crush that!

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:05.240
Don't worry, I told him to bring that core back with him.

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:06.370
That's not it!

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:06.870
Huh?

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:11.710
What the...

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:12.880
Zonder!

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:20.470
It got away!

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:23.220
It escaped the Battlefield!

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:25.430
Unable to track by satellite!

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:27.560
I'm scanning the Repression Field!

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:29.480
At that size, its electromagnetic emissions are...

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:31.980
...indistinguishable from anything near it!

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:35.060
The surveillance system isn't picking up anything!

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:39.650
Looks like we're right back where we started, huh?

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:43.910
Gai, you have less than 30 seconds before the Field times out!

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:44.820
All right.

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:51.290
GaoGaiGar, returning to base!

00:03:56.380 --> 00:04:00.050
Repression Field extinguished. Starting natural decompression!

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:13.640
All readings are stable. Now arresting-out.

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:29.200
Decompression 100%! Exiting Arresting Mode!

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:32.250
Damage to property and infrastructure, zero!

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:34.080
A resounding success, sir!

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:36.540
Good job, one and all!

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:37.500
Huh?

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:49.510
And so the city escaped devastation.

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:54.770
But GGG continues to hunt the core of the enemy robot, the Zonder.

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:14.710
You wait right here, kid.

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:15.540
Okay.

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:26.590
Seems like that kid has the power to sense Zonders' whereabouts.

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:28.970
He's an amazing kid, that Mamoru.

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:32.640
By the way, are you holding up all right?

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:35.060
Yes, thanks to Mamoru.

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:39.360
Who knew he could boost the power of the G-Stone that keeps you alive?

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:43.030
That little squirt's got one surprise after another up his sleeve!

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:45.950
Huh? Hey, where the heck did he go?

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:48.410
It's here...

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:03.550
Zonder...

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:06.510
I have a feeling he's here somewhere.

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:10.760
Listen...

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:12.850
You don't have to be scared!

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:14.720
Come out and let me see you!

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:17.810
I'll turn you back to who you were before!

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:27.110
Zonder!

00:06:28.240 --> 00:06:30.030
Don't... don't worry...

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:39.420
Will Knife!

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:48.630
Shoot, it got away.

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:52.090
Mamoru!

00:06:52.510 --> 00:06:53.640
Get a hold of yourself...

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:54.510
Are you all right?

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:12.240
He's had a mild concussion...

00:07:12.370 --> 00:07:14.870
He should go home and get some rest.

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:18.790
Mamoru, I'm so glad you're all right.

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:22.000
Thank you very much.

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:24.670
Listen, about that Zonder...

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:27.710
Do you have any idea where it might have run off to?

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:32.300
Well, right now I'm not sensing anything.

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:38.890
You mean you don't understand yourself what you've been doing?

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:41.810
Right. I have no idea what a Zonder is...

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:45.400
...or why I'm able to turn them back into humans again.

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:48.190
Being able to fly away like that without thinking about it...

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:49.820
Now that's an amazing power.

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:50.990
Yeah...

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:53.240
Oh, that's where I live.

00:07:58.790 --> 00:07:59.750
Thank you.

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:06.630
Hey, you can't ever tell my mom and dad about this, okay?

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:07.750
Promise me...

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:09.670
Sure, I promise.

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:11.670
Hey, this is for you.

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:16.890
A pager?

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:19.270
If you ever detect any Zonders...

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:22.560
...or remember anything else, be sure to contact me, all right?

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:23.730
All right!

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:25.980
The instructions are on the back.

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:27.480
Wow...

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:32.240
Sometimes I'll have to contact you, so keep it with you all the time.

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:33.530
Waha!

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:36.620
I feel like a spy or something. How cool is that?

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:51.800
One Week Later

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:56.140
It looks like tomorrow's shuttle launch will be able to proceed on schedule.

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:59.050
According to the forecast, it will be a fine day tomorrow.

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:01.310
Isn't it all very exciting, Mr. President?

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:03.100
Good job, Sakura.

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:09.610
Still, to think we still haven't found it...

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:12.900
Where in the world can that Zonder be hiding?

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:27.080
M-Mister President!

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:32.460
If I remember correctly, your name's Amami, right?

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:33.550
Yes, sir...

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:37.260
Um, is it possible that I messed up somehow, sir?

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:41.260
Oh, no, I just happened to see this photo on your desk.

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:44.230
Hmm, what kind of boy is he?

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:46.480
Oh, you mean my son?

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:48.520
Well, now, I don't know what to say, sir...

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:51.940
He's a 3rd-grader, but for heaven's sake, instead of hitting the books...

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:54.070
...he'd rather play all day, you see...

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:55.280
Is that right?

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:57.950
I have a feeling he'll become a great man one day!

00:09:58.360 --> 00:09:59.570
Cherish him, now.

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:03.040
Yes, sir! I will take those kind words of yours to heart!

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:05.370
Waha!

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:12.710
Are you sure this guy really used to be that pro-wrestler Zonder?

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:16.260
They say he's transformed from bad guy to champion of justice!

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:21.800
Ha! Even his personality changed, huh?

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:27.020
Apparently to be Zonderized means getting possessed by some entity...

00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:30.560
...that can amplify a human's excessive hatred or jealousy.

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:39.110
Huh! So what is it that possesses them?

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:41.240
If we knew that, our job would be easy.

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:44.830
And once we know, it'll be that much easier to fight the Zonders.

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:48.000
Whatever happened to the Zonder who got away?

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:50.920
First we've got to find out what they're after...

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:53.540
...until then, it's anybody's guess.

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:01.930
Do you think Dad's going to be working all night again?

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:04.600
Well, tomorrow's the day of the space shuttle launch.

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:06.270
I'm sure they're in a last-minute frenzy.

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:10.060
I heard this shuttle's engine has the most powerful thrusters in the world!

00:11:10.190 --> 00:11:13.400
So that's keeping your father even busier!

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:14.480
I'm home!

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:15.230
Huh?

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:16.280
He's home!

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:19.070
Welcome home!

00:11:19.200 --> 00:11:21.910
Boy oh boy, I can't believe how hectic it is!

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:24.450
I just came back to get a change of clothes.

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:26.830
What? You mean you're going back?

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:29.870
Right, it's going to be another all-nighter...

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:32.290
Just don't push yourself too hard, all right?

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:34.540
Uh-huh, gotcha.

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:37.210
Okay, I'm all set!

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:40.130
Hey, I almost forgot.

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:43.720
Mr. Taiga, the president, came to my desk just to see me today.

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:45.510
He asked me about you, Mamoru.

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:46.640
Huh?

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:50.560
He said that one day, you'd become a great man!

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:53.480
Who, me?

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:59.240
But I've known since you were a baby you'd grow up to be great!

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:03.910
Did the President say anything else?

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:07.870
Yes, he told me to be sure to cherish you!

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:09.830
See? My cherished boy!

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:11.620
Waha!

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:15.210
Hey, put me down, Dad!

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:16.630
Isamu, here's your lunchbox!

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:18.960
Hey, no fair!

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:22.090
Mamoru's not just your little boy, you know!

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:24.640
Waha!

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:39.480
Zonder...

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:41.280
Zonder...

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:43.570
Zonder...

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:12.730
Behold, that's the most powerful machine on earth today.

00:13:13.310 --> 00:13:16.980
A mere locomotive can't even hold a candle to this machine's power...

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:19.570
There's an endlessly vast world above the sky.

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:22.900
A magnificent world, untainted by the dinginess of Earth.

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:26.740
It should be more than enough to satisfy your heart.

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:42.590
"I'm sensing a Zonder..."

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:44.550
"The shuttle's in danger!"

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:53.100
Receiving word from Mamoru, GGG searches for the fugitive Zonder...

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:56.890
...thought to be planning an assault on the space shuttle.

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:10.820
Forty minutes until lift-off.

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:14.040
All personnel are asked to leave the launch pad.

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:21.000
We're running out of time!

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:24.420
But we can still put in a request to abort the launch.

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:28.630
How can we ask them to call it off when we haven't found the Zonder?

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:30.840
It's a dilemma, eh?

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:37.310
It'll be dangerous to abort the launch once fueling begins.

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:38.480
Just drop it!

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:42.190
That Mamoru must've been half-asleep or something.

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:43.900
He's just a kid...

00:14:43.980 --> 00:14:45.360
Remember, kids make mistakes!

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:51.280
Thirty minutes until lift-off.

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:53.740
The astronaut is now boarding the shuttle.

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:02.000
Now fuelling the main engines...

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:11.390
The space shuttle will be launched during first period today.

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:14.970
This shuttle is equipped with a special kind of engine.

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:17.470
I'd like you all to take a good look so you can see...

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:19.180
...how different it is from past shuttles.

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:21.150
Yes, sir!

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:26.230
Now commencing countdown...

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:27.860
Fifteen minutes until lift-off.

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:34.370
Zonder!

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:36.290
What's going on?

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:39.200
The engine thrust is increasing too rapidly!

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:48.880
No!

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:58.680
Huh? It's already in the air and it's not even lift-off time?

00:15:58.770 --> 00:16:00.140
It's really loud!

00:16:00.230 --> 00:16:02.310
You bet it is! It's a new type of engine!

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:06.730
This isn't good... If it makes it into space...

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:17.410
Zonder!

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:21.040
Just as I thought, you've become part of the shuttle...

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:23.540
But I'm not going to let you have your way!

00:16:30.590 --> 00:16:33.340
Equip!

00:16:48.070 --> 00:16:50.730
Will Knife!

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:03.330
Hey! They separated the boosters at a really low altitude!

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:08.460
Hey Mamoru, don't you think that shuttle has a funny shape?

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:22.810
Galeon! You're a sight for sore eyes!

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:26.230
Fusion!

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:32.570
GaiGar!

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:39.950
Zonder!

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:53.050
Hana!

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:56.680
I'm a former astronaut!

00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:59.340
I know space shuttles like the back of my hand!

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:02.850
And no shuttle's gonna make it to outer space without fuel!

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:14.190
It's going to be all right now, Hana.

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:15.860
I'm not afraid, I'm not afraid...

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:31.170
He's signaling for Final Fusion...

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:32.040
Where's the Chief?

00:18:34.880 --> 00:18:35.880
I'm right here.

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:38.470
Final Fusion, approved!

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:39.640
Roger!

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:41.140
Final Fusion...

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:43.350
Program Drive!

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:56.320
Final Fusion!

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:39.280
GaoGaiGar!

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:56.460
Broken Magnum!

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:13.400
The Zonder Shuttle has tumbled into the sea.

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:16.150
At this rate, we're going to lose the ability to track it.

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:18.480
Launch the Dividing Driver!

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:19.480
Roger!

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:21.030
Do you mean to split the ocean?

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:22.700
A hero should be up to the task!

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:24.870
I guess you're right.

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:27.450
Dividing Driver...

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:28.830
All set to go!

00:20:28.910 --> 00:20:30.450
Opening the Mirror Catapult!

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:35.500
Locking down coordinates, okay!

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:40.170
Commencing Mirror Coating!

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:44.970
Launch!

00:20:53.190 --> 00:20:55.600
Coordinates, locked down!

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:10.950
Dividing Driver!

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:21.670
I've got to get there...

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:23.470
I've got to get there, or it won't work!

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:27.800
Protect Shade!

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:01.920
Oh, great! I made it!

00:22:07.050 --> 00:22:09.050
Curatio...

00:22:09.800 --> 00:22:12.680
...teneritas, sectio...

00:22:13.310 --> 00:22:17.190
...salus, coctura!

00:22:25.740 --> 00:22:27.110
Thanks, Mamoru.

00:22:27.240 --> 00:22:29.360
We all need your power.

00:22:29.610 --> 00:22:32.120
I think I'm beginning to understand now.

00:22:32.280 --> 00:22:35.040
This power must've been given to me by God...

00:22:35.330 --> 00:22:38.120
...so I could save people all around the world.

00:22:38.960 --> 00:22:41.960
Yes, you're probably right.

00:22:46.660 --> 00:22:50.560
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.760 --> 00:22:55.430
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.830 --> 00:23:01.610
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.610 --> 00:23:06.400
and you're searching for me.

00:23:07.030 --> 00:23:10.570
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.740 --> 00:23:17.500
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.560 --> 00:23:24.260
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:24.260 --> 00:23:28.920
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:29.610 --> 00:23:34.260
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:34.260 --> 00:23:41.160
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:45.320 --> 00:23:48.150
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:48.490 --> 00:23:51.660
Two new members have joined the GGG Mobile Unit.

00:23:51.860 --> 00:23:54.370
